# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# IOAESAccelerator (the kernel's MiniIOAESAccelerator.cpp, UniXNU's SoftwareAES): AES-CBC round trips
# through the user client against NIST SP 800-38A's vectors, and the refusals (src/aes_test.c). Then a
# while for iOS's own clients (online-auth-agent, mobilerepaird ...) to come and ask: the kernel logs
# each hardware key a program asks for once ("asked for hardware key 0x...").
/redwood/bin/aes_test
sleep 60
/bin/ps -A
